    ('play the old song slowly, as a lament, and let the room feel the year', 'R1', None, 0.45, '', {'v': 'benevolence', 'chance': 0.8}),
    ('keep the old song as it is: it has carried the town through worse', 'G1', None, 0.45, '', {'identity': True, 'v': 'tradition', 'chance': 0.7}),
    ('play the song as printed, then end with a fierce, joyful piece of your own', 'W1', 'R.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'tradition, stimulation', 'chance': 0.72}),
    ('find the old verse about lean years that newer songbooks dropped, and restore it', 'U1', 'G.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'tradition', 'chance': 0.75}),
    ('get the minister on side before the committee meets, so the matter is settled', 'B1', 'W.7', 0.5, '', {'v': 'power, security', 'chance': 0.65}),
